.UNINDENT
.SS Methods
.SS void Release()
.sp
This method gets called when \fBbluetoothd(8)\fP unregisters the profile. The
profile can use it to do cleanup tasks.
.sp
There is no need to unregister the profile, because when this method gets called
it has already been unregistered.
.SS Properties
.SS array{string} UUIDs [read\-only]
.sp
128\-bit GATT service UUIDs to auto connect.
